        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/d9b06d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-12-31T00:34:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Your interpretation is correct. This does cause AZ to deal himself a lot of fire damage but if he can sustain the hit than this is counteracted by his modules allowing him to heal himself for all the damage dealt (and then some with focused aperture). This makes for an extremely powerful Coolant Blast next turn. This is why I enjoy playing Absolute Zero  ;D</p>",
